  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e20ce9f6737e6e845b50655fcc50fb57, type: 3}
  m_Name: Guardian3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: Hand of Torvalds
  lines:
  - You have learned the power of sharing.
  - But freedom means little if you cannot control what you create.
  - Programs may serve you faithfully...
  - or they may refuse to obey.
  - When all other commands fail, one remains.
  - This is The Will of Torvalds.
  - Come. Prove you deserve it.
